      "text": "Step 2: The given equation is \\(f(x) - f(a) = (x - a)^2 (x - b)\\). Expanding the right side, we get:\n\\[\n(x - a)^2 (x - b) = (x^2 - 2ax + a^2)(x - b) = x^3 - bx^2 - 2ax^2 + 2abx + a^2x - a^2b = x^3 - (2a+b)x^2 + (2ab+a^2)x - a^2b.\n\\]",
